cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or software, please cite it as below, and credit the data sources listed in DATA_LICENSE.md."
title: "Leakage-aware, spatially cross-validated landslide-reactivation modeling with tabular and geospatial foundation models"
abstract: >-
  Code and compiled inventory for benchmarking engineered terrain covariates
  against state-of-the-art foundation models (TabPFN v2, Prithvi-EO, SatCLIP)
  for landslide reactivation in an undermined Appalachian coalfield, with
  definitional-leakage removal, spatial block cross-validation, and probability
  calibration. Software is released under MIT; the compiled dataset under
  CC BY 4.0 (see DATA_LICENSE.md).
type: software
authors:
